{
  "name": "SaveReceiverDetail",
  "deprecated": false,
  "protocol": "HTTP|HTTPS",
  "method": "GET|POST",
  "pathPattern": "",
  "parameters": [
    {
      "name": "CustomDetail",
      "description": "收件人邮箱及模版参数，数组格式",
      "position": "Query",
      "type": "String",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Detail",
      "description": "内容，支持一次上传多个收件人，每次限制500 条记录，每个用{}和逗号隔开，示例：\n\n[{ },{ },{ }...]，{}中的内容格式。如下：\n\n[{\"b\":\"birthday\",\"e\":\"xxx@example.net\",\"g\":\"gender\",\"m\":\"mobile\",\"n\":\"nickname\",\"u\":\"name\"}]，传值时传字符串，非列表。\n\n若插入重复收件人地址，会返回\"ErrorCount\": 1",
      "position": "Query",
      "type": "String",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "name": "ReceiverId",
      "description": "收件人列表ID",
      "position": "Query",
      "type": "String",
      "required": true
    }
  ],
  "example": {
    "unifiedCli": "aliyun dm save-receiver-detail --receiver-id 34642 --detail b_:_birthday_,_e_:_xxx@alibaba-inc.com_,_g_:_gender_,_m_:_mobile_,_n_:_nickname_,_u_:_name --custom-detail Email_:_example@alimail.com_,_CustomData_:_name_:_Tom_,_age_:_30 --api-version 2015-11-23 --region cn-hangzhou",
    "legacyCli": "aliyun dm SaveReceiverDetail --region cn-hangzhou --ReceiverId 34642 --Detail 'b_:_birthday_,_e_:_xxx@alibaba-inc.com_,_g_:_gender_,_m_:_mobile_,_n_:_nickname_,_u_:_name' --CustomDetail 'Email_:_example@alimail.com_,_CustomData_:_name_:_Tom_,_age_:_30'"
  }
